autowrap_mode = 2
text = "AscendKeep is built with Godot Engine 4.7 (MIT License, godotengine.org).

Icons: Lucide (lucide.dev), ISC License. Full list in assets/icons/CREDITS.md.

In-battle sprites (the Core, the Voidborn, the projectile): original artwork made for this game, generated from prompts stored in prompt/*.json — not from any third-party pack.

Sound effects: Kenney (Interface Sounds, CC0) and artisticdude (RPG Sound Pack, CC0), via OpenGameArt.

Ads: optional rewarded videos from Google AdMob, shown only when you tap \"Watch an ad\". Purchases: optional, through Google Play. Cloud save: an anonymous Firebase account, Google sign-in is optional. No other analytics or tracking."

